    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1004\"><p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1004\"><em data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1004\">“The city told me where you’d be.”</em></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1274\">Street Prophets are <strong data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1061\">social infiltration specialists</strong>, attuned to the living pulse of neighborhoods, crowds, and informal power. Where others rely on stealth or force, you weaponize <strong data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1225\">attention, belief, and movement</strong>—turning rumor into Access and people into cover.</p><p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1321\">You don’t fight the city.<br data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1304\" />You listen to it.</p>",
